 :59 UTC+12 (assumed)\n  Camera-ready: 1 Jul 2027\, 23:59 UTC+12 (assumed)\
 n  Author registration: 1 Jul 2027\, 23:59 UTC+12 (assumed)\n\nThe call fo
 r papers states no timezone. This is counted as UTC+12\, the earliest it c
 ould plausibly mean\, so the countdown runs out before the real deadline r
 ather than after it.\n\n5th edition of the conference. Papers are limited 
